WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
They suffer from different ailments, but share one common disease:

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:07.000
the long wait for tests and treatment.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:10.000
This is the X-ray of São Paulo's healthcare system:

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:14.000
slow, and with no respect for those who need care.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:17.000
Haddad will give people their time back, with the Hora Certa Network:

00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:24.000
health centers for appointments, tests and minor surgeries, all in one place.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:27.000
It's the time savings São Paulo needs.
